│ 26.5 (3.6) kg/m(2) (p < 0.001) and from 3.3 (1,4) to 2.6 (1.2) kg/m(2) (p < 0.001). Diary fruit intake increased     │
│ from 63.3% to 82.7% of patients (p < 0.001) and greens from 45.6% to 88,2% of patients (p < 0.001). Breakfast intake │
