SELECTION CRITERIA:
We selected randomised controlled trials (RCTs) of diet, physical activity, and behavioural interventions 
(behaviour‐changing interventions) for treating overweight or obese children aged 6 to 11 years, with a minimum of six 
months' follow‐up. We excluded interventions that specifically dealt with the treatment of eating disorders or type 2 
diabetes, or included participants with a secondary or syndromic cause of obesity.

INSTRUCTIONS: For each study below, decide INCLUDE or EXCLUDE.
